                                "sense_id": "f4b663ac-303d-3ea2-8734-3b5372986814",
                                "text": "“In light of the current state of our country, I struggled to find the right words of wisdom for you today,” Obama says in her lengthiest public remarks to date about the protests taking place in the wake of the killing of George Floyd."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3c3d569c-e374-4639-92a6-8c442f3aec34",
                                "sense_id": "f4b663ac-303d-3ea2-8734-3b5372986814",
                                "text": "Couple this with the apparent nationwide divide over issues ranging from George Floyd’s death to wearing coronavirus masks, and you’ve got the ideal environment for the wokefish to thrive."
                            }
                        ]
